      "writtenOn": "2013-10-21T14:01:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do not agree with splitting here.\nThe key stored in the database is encrypted and signed with the master key, and this enc and sig are the encypted version of the key and the signature on the same key. These are not independent values that make sense to ever set or get separately. By storing them this way people may think they are the actual service keys, they are not.",
      "revId": "9b20a319365ae7e34a6bc21900f37fef2d2de07d",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
