        "id": 2218
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-10-24T16:39:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The names should reflect the relationship.  enc_key is the key, just in encrypted form, so calling that column value or encrypted is correct.  the other column should be \"signature\".  Lets not get cryptic on the naming:  spell things out so they are as self documenting as possible, but remember that these are all attributes of the same entity.  A key doesn\u0027t have a \"key\" attribute.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAATH//NRk\u003d",
